        <mxCell id="candidateAssemblyContract" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;strokeColor=#334155;fillColor=#ffffff;spacing=7;shape=note;fillColor=#fff7df;fontSize=14;align=left;" value="LLM CANDIDATE ASSEMBLY — TP-01 / TP-AH-01 / UC-01 step 4&#xa;Proposed LLMAdapter helper: assembleCandidates(confirmedRequest : TravelRequest,&#xa;offers : SupplierOffer[*]) : ItineraryVersion[*]. Synchronise this operation with G-04.&#xa;Return provisional complete itineraries with source links; no feasibility claim.&#xa;The subsequent validation loop remains the authority for constraints and prices." vertex="1">
